  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive). This is the causative-like form of ⟦{知|し}る→知る：00458_shiru⟧ (to know). Pattern: X⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧ Y⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{知|し}らせる (inform X of Y).\n\nASPECT: て⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ indicates completed action. {知|し}らせて⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ = 'has informed.'\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- X⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{知|し}らせる (notify of X)\n- {知|し}らせて⟦ください→下さい：02899_kudasai⟧ (please let me know)\n- ⟦お{知|し}らせ→お知らせ：18843_oshirase⟧ (notification, announcement—polite noun)\n- ⟦{知|し}らせ→知らせ：03252_shirase⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{届|とど}く→届く：00899_todoku⟧ (news arrives)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{知|し}る→知る：00458_shiru⟧: to know, to learn (base verb)\n- ⟦{知|し}らせ→知らせ：03252_shirase⟧: notification, news (noun form)\n- ⟦お{知|し}らせ→お知らせ：18843_oshirase⟧: announcement (polite noun)\n\nCONTRAST WITH ⟦{伝|つた}える→伝える：01220_tsutaeru⟧:\n- {知|し}らせる: to inform (make someone aware)\n- ⟦{伝|つた}える→伝える：01220_tsutaeru⟧: to convey, tell (pass on a message)\n\nBoth can mean 'inform,' but ⟦{伝|つた}える→伝える：01220_tsutaeru⟧ emphasizes the transfer of a message.",
